  unitName: Captain Yuuri
  unitId: 50775
  unitNumber: 1066
  description: A warrior from another world guided by the Chain Chronicle. In order
    to bring the world he had envisioned into a reality, Yuuri transformed the bonds
    he had created with others into a bright light, using it to stop the powerful
    enemies that stood in his way. Believing in his friends, by the time the long
    battle had come to its conclusion he had led a great number of Volunteer Army
    warriors to become the savior of Yggdra. In the aftermath, when the continent
    had plunged into chaos once again, Yuuri and his comrades set off towards a new
    land in order to save their world. However, many trials would await the Volunteer
    Army as it battled its way towards fulfilling this new dream.
  summonDesc: We have a goal to achieve.<br>Won't you fight with us<br>to help us
    realize our dream?
  fusionDesc: Thank you.<br>I'll keep fighting to make<br>our ideal world into a
    reality!
  evoDesc: Did you see that?<br>Yggdra could be saved thanks to<br>the power of the
    bonds made<br>by the Volunteer Army.
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
